<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Recopilación de Leyes de los Reinos de las Indias</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1680</span> · <a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Recopilación de Leyes de los Reinos de las <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">Indias</a> was a comprehensive compilation of the laws governing <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a>'s American territories, published in 1680. It was produced under the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/council-of-the-indies">Council of the Indies</a>, which governed the colonies from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madrid">Madrid</a>. The code covered nearly every aspect of colonial administration in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spanish-empire">Spanish Empire</a>.</p></div>
